:49:17Z","value":34,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4751830","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1847286114033910","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog 11 - Ghost Train","summary":"Hello everyone!First of all, a huge thank you to everyone who is playing or has played The Dark West demo during Next Fest! We’re reading and collecting all the feedback you’ve been sending us, and it means a lot.Looking ahead, we’ve just released Devlog 11! In this one, Woolie, Lighty, and Corey show off one of the mechanics coming in Early Access: the Ghost Train. In the video, they walk through the creation process, share some early footage of the system, and show how the three of them reach ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T19:00:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033910","verified_at":"2026-10-22T19:45:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1846651706691295","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dark West Updated Demo is Out!","summary":"The Dark West is part of Steam Next Fest, and the new demo is up!Play the demo now: FULL PATCH NOTES BELOW:THE SALOON & ALCOHOLThe Saloon is now open and can be entered and explored.The Saloon is still in development, so some areas and content may continue to receive polish in future updates.Added the Bartender, who now sells Alcohol.Added the first version of the Alcohol System.Alcohol can be equipped and consumed to provide temporary gameplay effects.Added the following Alcohol types:Whiskey: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1846651706687845","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dark West just hit 100K Wishlists!","summary":"A lot of you have been here since the very first trailer, the early screenshots, the first time we shared something. You wishlisted, shared, commented and sent us your feedback, and that’s a big part of how we got here.We’re a small indie team, so it means a lot to see this many people backing the game this early. We read everything you send us, and it keeps us going.Play our updated demo during Steam Next Fest, starting tomorrow at 10:00 AM PDT/17:00 UTC. (Download it through The Dark West Stea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:30:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687845","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1846651706678987","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Bottoms Up! Alcohol Arrives in the Next Fest Demo","summary":"The updated demo for Steam Next Fest comes with something new behind the bar: your first taste of our Alcohol system! For the demo, we're serving up a streamlined version of the system, built to be easy to pick up and use! 7 different drinks to find, each with its own effectInstead of a mana-style resource flask, you now carry Alcohol, which gives you temporary effects (your HP flask is unchanged)Buy Alcohol from the bartender at the Double Deuce Saloon in Mercy's End, or find it as loot out in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:00:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678987","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1846018067944810","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The new trailer for The Dark West is out now!","summary":"We are thrilled to reveal the new trailer for The Dark West ahead of next fest! In this new trailer, you’ll get a deeper look into the world of The Dark West, a first preview of our brand-new Alcohol System, and a glimpse into what the future holds for the game!We also want to take a moment to thank everyone who has been supporting us since day one. Building a game of this scope with a small team is no easy feat, but we’re working tirelessly to make sure the final experience is something you’ll ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T17:08:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1846018067934258","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dark West is Coming to Steam Next Fest with an Updated Demo!","summary":"We are incredibly excited to announce that The Dark West will be officially participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest!Following our previous playtests and the invaluable feedback we received from you all, we’ve taken the time to really refine the experience. What to Expect in the Updated DemoPerformance OptimizationsGeneral Bug FixesEnemy/weapons balance changesAnd a few surprises! The festival kicks off on Monday, October 19 and wraps up on Monday, October 26. The new demo will be available","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T18:00:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934258","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1843481262693395","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Vlog 10 - Environment","summary":"Hey everyone!We’re back with another behind-the-scenes look at The Dark West. This time, we’re diving into the game’s environment design with our Environment Artist, Piotr. He shares his background and tells the great story of how a surprise message from an old friend led him to take a leap of faith into a brand new role at the studio!In this video, Piotr walks us through his workflow and the immense freedom he has when shaping the game's visuals alongside the team. He gives us a behind-the-scen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T21:02:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693395","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1842212951304131","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"update","title":"Important Update: Demo Going Offline Sept 1st","summary":"Hello everyone! A massive thank you to everyone who played The Dark West demo and shared their feedback! Your support over the last two months has been incredible. To ensure we deliver the absolute best experience for the upcoming Steam Next Fest, we will be temporarily removing the current public demo on September 1st. We're taking it offline to give it a proper overhaul, but don't worry, you'll be able to play a fully updated version during the October Next Fest! While we work on these improve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T19:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1842212951300810","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Vlog 9 - Illustrations and Concept art","summary":"Hey everyone!We’re back with another behind-the-scenes look at The Dark West. This time, we’re diving into the game’s visual development with our Illustrator and Concept Artist, Polo McPrieto. He shares his background and tells the amazing (and funny) story of how he joined our team, only to discover his art was already being used as a reference for the game!In this video, Polo walks us through his creative process, the freedom he has in shaping the game's visuals alongside our Game Director, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T17:10:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1840944183780296","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Road to Early Access: Thank You for the Demo Feedback!","summary":"Hello Everyone! First off, we want to give a massive thank you to everyone who took the time to jump into The Dark West demo and share your experiences, videos, and incredibly detailed feedback on our Discord, on steam community forum, even on YT comment section.The recent re-release of the demo brought some fantastic results, especially on the technical front. We were thrilled to see that the optimization and stability improvements held up, allowing so many of you to explore the weird west with","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T17:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183780296","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1840310314342266","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"update","title":"The Dark West Demo - Demo Patch v0.0.102s","summary":"Hello everyone!We have released a minor update (build v0.0.103s) to address several known issues within the demo. Changes & AdditionsImproved blood visuals.Improved Black Bill abilities VFX and transformation visuals.Bug FixesFixed an issue where it was impossible to rebind abilities.Fixed a waypoint VFX memory leak.Fixed Lucky Shot not displaying on the HUD.Fixed embedded charge issues.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T15:34:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1839676055891137","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dark West: Live Developer Q&A!","summary":"Hey everyone!We're back with another Q&A for The Dark West. Lighty and Woolie will be hosting, answering your questions about the demo, the future of the game, and everything in between! When: We'll be going live at 4 PM PST | 7 PM ET | 12 AM UTCWhere: Our Twitch Channel Please drop any questions you have in the Twitch chat. We're going to do our absolute best to get through every single one. See you there!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T17:19:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055891137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1839676055888552","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"update","title":"The Dark West Demo - Demo Patch v0.0.102s","summary":"Hello everyone!We have released another update to address several known issues within the demo. Changes & AdditionsAdded a grace period for knockdown and knockback.Replaced masterwork icons.Improved shotgun VFX.Increased Blackbill damage by 16%.Reduced Acolyte cast time to 0.5s.Removed the 1.5s cooldown before the Acolyte attack.Ricochet by default now has only 1 chain.Sharpshooter III now applies a 3s Blitz.Desecrated text no longer triggers when the effect happens.Removed Harrow T2 collision o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T15:27:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888552","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1839041357022579","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"update","title":"The Dark West Demo - Demo Patch v0.0.98s","summary":"Hello everyone! We have released a minor update to address several known issues within the demo. Changes & AdditionsAdded settings to the main menu (the input section was intentionally removed).Removed auto-equip from settings (it is now ON by default).Improved the audio workflow on the credits screen.Removed the Shard of Xorcaris Runestone.Bug FixesFixed a memory leak related to projectile effects.Fixed missing SFX for bullet impacts.Fixed a crash that occurred when shooting Hexshot with Hollow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T22:30:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357022579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1838407329266085","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dark West Demo Is Here! Complete it for a chance to win a game key!","summary":"The Dark West Demo Has Just Released!Our team worked tirelessly to resolve the performance issues, and we can't wait for you to jump in and experience the demo for yourself!We want to thank you all for your support, especially everyone who participated in our internal playtest and helped ensure the demo ran smoothly across a wide variety of PC configurations.To celebrate, we're hosting a giveaway on our official Discord server, where two lucky winners will receive a key for the game when it laun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T17:02:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329266085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1837955055361547","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Returns July 20!","summary":"First, we want to thank everyone for your patience while the demo has been offline. We know many of you have been waiting to jump back in, and we truly appreciate all of the encouragement and understanding you've shown us over the past few weeks. We're happy to announce that the demo will return on July 20! Since temporarily removing it, we've been hard at work addressing the performance and technical issues that many of you reported. We've made significant improvements to stability, optimized p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T17:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055361547","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1835236783558893","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Temporarily Removed","summary":"Hi everyone! First, we want to say thank you to everyone who took the time to play our demo and share their feedback. Reading your positive comments, seeing your reactions, and hearing that people were enjoying the experience genuinely made our day. The support we've received has meant a lot to our team. Unfortunately, we've also discovered a number of performance and technical issues that are preventing some players from experiencing the demo the way it was intended. Because of this, we've made","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T00:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783558893","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1834602721200075","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for 75,000 Wishlists!","summary":"We couldn't have done this without you. Every share, every comment, every bit of feedback, and every wishlist pushed us forward. If you've been following the game, you're part of this. Thank you for being on this journey with us. June is going to be a big month for us. In case you missed it, here’s the trailer for our demo, which will be available on June 10th:Our demo will also be participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest, starting on June 15th at 10 AM PDT.Until then, you can dive deeper i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T20:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200075","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1834602721185474","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"Step into The Dark West – Demo Available June 10th","summary":"We're proud to announce that the demo for The Dark West will be available on June 10th! That means there's only one week left before you can jump into this world filled with corruption and try to keep your neck clean.Take a look at our demo trailer here:Are you ready to face the darkness?Make sure to wishlist The Dark West so you don't miss the demo launch:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T17:24:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721185474","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1833334318572689","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The World of The Dark West: Kane, The Gunslinger","summary":"Welcome back, everyone!Before we begin, we would like to apologize and address an issue in our latest post: the Masterwork was shown incorrectly (the item was generated incorrectly for the screenshots). We've since updated the post with the correct GFX.Now, it’s time to take a look at the playable class available in our upcoming demo: Kane, the Gunslinger.They say fortune doesn’t favor the brave, only the faster hand and the heavier iron. There’s just one thing between him and whatever he sets h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T20:01:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318572689","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3574750-1832700592793047","game_id":"steam-3574750","kind":"announcement","title":"The World of The Dark West: Gear Up!","summary":"Welcome back, everyone!It’s every ARPG player’s favorite time: loot!Let’s take a closer look at the main criteria used to categorize your gear.ClassesThe class of an item refers to its category, ranging from weapons like rifles, revolvers, and shotguns to accessories such as rings, trinkets, and poker cards.AffixesYou're probably familiar with the term, but if you're not: affixes are modifier lines attached to an item. They can range from simple stats like Increased Attack Speed to more complex ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T20:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592793047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:49Z","disco